  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a Black man with a joyful expression, juxtaposed with a hateful and violent text overlay that falsely claims 'we can kill as many as we want and your stupid government keeps bringing us in.' This text is a direct attack targeting Muslim communities (implied by the head covering) and Black people (the subject's race), invoking Islamophobia and anti-Black racism. The meme uses the visual of a smiling individual to contrast with the violent, conspiratorial message, aiming to incite fear and hatred toward these groups. The intent is to spread hateful rhetoric by associating Muslim and Black communities with terrorism and criminality, which is a clear example of hateful content targeting protected characteristics.",
